Spoilers...


First of all, you need to get Nethack.  Many things that works in Hack do
not work in Nethack and vice versa.  Following are general methods to get
out of vault.

1. Teleport out 
2. Dig your way out with wand of digging or pick-axe.  Regular axe won't do
   it.
3. Polymorph yourself into a monster with above intrinsics (dwarf, Umber
   Hulk, Leprechen...)  I don't think this works in Hack, though.
4. Polymorph the guard into something useful like...
	a leprechen (or tengu) and eat it.  You will gain teleport
	ability.  Don't forget to drop your gold before fighting leprechen.

	or Quantum Mechanic which might teleport you when he hits.
	(Does Hack have it?)
   The guard will come back after he left or even after you killed him, so
   you can wait for him.  (Do you have any other choice?)


BTW, the name of the person who built the vault is "Croesus"....



